      "source": "Qualifier annotation for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> to be injected into Batch\nauto-configuration. Can be used on a secondary <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>, if\nthere is another one marked as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Primary.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Primary</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于注入到批处理自动配置中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 的限定注解。如果存在另一个标记为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Primary.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Primary</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>，则可在次要 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 上使用此注解。",
